							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"terminals",
								"options"
							]
						},
						"description": "Lightweight terminal feed for selectors and name lookups (decision R-45, 22.08.2026). Returns a bare array of {id, name, status} — no pagination, and no terminal credentials: login and password are absent from the DTO, not masked. BLOCKED terminals ARE included on purpose: the link form takes only ACTIVE ones from the answer, while the transaction screen needs every terminal to keep naming the terminal an old payment went through. Access rules are the same as GET /api/v1/terminals."
					},
					"response": []
